{"id":"en_my-billionaire-ex-wants-me-back","title":"My Billionaire Ex Wants Me Back","titleEn":"My Billionaire Ex Wants Me Back","description":"Alison Johnson has quietly loved Dylan Garcia for eight years. After Kara Davis drugs her, Alison sleeps with Dylan, and from that night on she stays at his side as nothing more than a casual convenience. When Kara reappears two years later, Dylan drops Alison without hesitation. Just as Alison resolves to walk away for good, she discovers she is pregnant with his child.\n\nAlison gathers her courage and tells Dylan she wants to keep the baby. He responds by offering marriage and a role as the child's father, which revives her hope that he might truly care for her. What follows, however, sends her spiraling back into despair. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/my-billionaire-ex-wants-me-back/en_US/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/my-billionaire-ex-wants-me-back/en_US/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["CEO","Love-Torture","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duop8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-ex-wants-me-back_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duop8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-ex-wants-me-back_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duop8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-ex-wants-me-back_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duop8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{